<div id="lw-pr-content-9-c4d5e6f7" class="wp-block-wdl-lw-pr-content-9 lw-pr-content-9 init-hide"><div class="lw-pr-content-9__wrap"><div class="swiper lw-pr-content-9-swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="item"><div class="image"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/atelier_02.webp" alt="裁ち終えた革のパーツ"/></div><h3>1日目の午前</h3><p>型紙を写して、革を裁つところまで。ここがいちばん時間がかかります。</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="item"><div class="image"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/atelier_03.webp" alt="菱目打ちで穴をあけている手元"/></div><h3>1日目の午後</h3><p>縫う穴をあけます。まっすぐ並ばなくても、あとで気にならなくなります。</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="item"><div class="image"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/works_01.webp" alt="縫い上がった小物"/></div><h3>2日目の午前</h3><p>手縫いです。ミシンは使いません。ここでだいたい3時間。</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="item"><div class="image"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/works_02.webp" alt="コバを磨いて仕上げた革小物"/></div><h3>2日目の午後</h3><p>コバ（切り口）を磨いて、金具を付けて完成です。その日にお持ち帰りいただけます。</p></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="item"><div class="image"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/sec/works_04.webp" alt="完成した革小物を並べたところ"/></div><h3>持ち帰ったあと</h3><p>使うほど色が変わります。半年後に一度、無料で手入れをします。</p></div></div></div><div class="swiper-pagination"></div></div></div><script type="text/javascript">
(function(){
    var selector = "#lw-pr-content-9-c4d5e6f7 .lw-pr-content-9-swiper";
    var MAX_RETRY = 30;
    var retry = 0;

    function initSwiper(){
        if ( typeof Swiper === "undefined" ) return false;
        var el = document.querySelector(selector);
        if ( !el ) return false;
        if ( el.swiper ) return true;

        new Swiper( selector, {
            slidesPerView: 4,
            spaceBetween: 24,
            loop: true,
            
            pagination: {
                el: selector + " .swiper-pagination",
                clickable: true
            },
            observer: true,
            observeParents: true,
            breakpoints: {
                0:    { slidesPerView: 1, spaceBetween: 24 },
                576:  { slidesPerView: 2, spaceBetween: 20 },
                992:  { slidesPerView: 3, spaceBetween: 24 },
                1200: { slidesPerView: 4, spaceBetween: 24 }
            }
        });
        document.querySelector("#lw-pr-content-9-c4d5e6f7").classList.remove("init-hide");
        return true;
    }

    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", initSwiper, { once:true });
    window.addEventListener("lw:swiperReady", initSwiper, { once:true });

    var timer = setInterval(function(){
        if ( initSwiper() || ++retry >= MAX_RETRY ) clearInterval(timer);
    }, 150);

    setTimeout(function(){
        var el = document.querySelector("#lw-pr-content-9-c4d5e6f7");
        if ( el ) el.classList.remove("init-hide");
    }, 5000);
})();
        </script><noscript><style>#lw-pr-content-9-c4d5e6f7{opacity:1!important}</style></noscript></div>
